				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;font-size: large;&#34;&gt;(18 June 2017) -&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;font-size: large;&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;font-size: large;&#34;&gt;Here are some moments of &lt;a class=&#34;m_-6025916263310964626gmail-_58cn&#34; href=&#34;https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/yogaday&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;#YogaDay&lt;/a&gt; Celebration at Chulalongkorn University in &lt;a class=&#34;m_-6025916263310964626gmail-_58cn&#34; href=&#34;https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/bangkok&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;#Bangkok&lt;/a&gt;. One of the psssionate moments was Se&lt;span class=&#34;m_-6025916263310964626gmail-text_exposed_show&#34;&gt;lfie with Deputy Prime Minister of Thailand H.E. General Tanasak Patimaprakorn and Ambasador of India to Thailand H.E. Shri Bhagwant Singh Bishnoi. (See few selected pictures enclosed) - See all pictures at www/&lt;a href=&#34;http://facebook.com/susheelkumarsaraff&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;facebook.com/&lt;wbr/&gt;susheelkumarsaraff&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;1s&#34; class=&#34;alignnone size-full wp-image-2170&#34; height=&#34;972&#34; src=&#34;https://www.saraffglobalhugo.saraffglobal.com/images/uploads/2017/06/1s-1.jpg&#34; width=&#34;1296&#34;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;Picture 2&#34; class=&#34;alignnone size-full wp-image-2173&#34; height=&#34;960&#34; src=&#34;https://www.saraffglobalhugo.saraffglobal.com/images/uploads/2017/06/Picture-2.jpg&#34; width=&#34;1280&#34;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;2-1&#34; class=&#34;alignnone size-full wp-image-2166&#34; height=&#34;750&#34; src=&#34;https://www.saraffglobalhugo.saraffglobal.com/images/uploads/2017/06/2-1.jpg&#34; width=&#34;1000&#34;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;2s&#34; class=&#34;alignnone wp