			<item>
				<title>(8 June 2017) - Saraff Global Team in Bangkok joined the royal ceremony and paid respect to the beloved late H.M. The King Bhumibol Adulyadej.</title>
				<link>https://www.saraffglobalhugo.saraffglobal.com/posts/8-june-2017-saraff-global-team-in-bangkok-joined-the-royal-ceremony-and-paid-respect-to-the-beloved-late-h-m-the-king-bhumibol-adulyadej-hm-the-late-king-rama-ix-will-always-remian-in-our-hearts/</link>
