				<description>&lt;p class=&#34;p1&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;(8 June 2017) - Saraff Global Team in Bangkok joined the royal ceremony today morning and paid respect to the beloved late H.M. The King Bhumibol Adulyadej. HM the Late King Rama IX will always remian in our hearts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;p1&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;18954656_1353377464769279_1365292493402356816_o&#34; class=&#34;alignnone size-full wp-image-2119&#34; height=&#34;1205&#34; src=&#34;https://www.saraffglobalhugo.saraffglobal.com/images/uploads/2017/06/18954656_1353377464769279_1365292493402356816_o-1.jpg&#34; width=&#34;2048&#34;/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;p1&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;19030377_1353377418102617_1311021061618575270_n&#34; class=&#34;alignnone size-full wp-image-2120&#34; height=&#34;960&#34; src=&#34;https://www.saraffglobalhugo.saraffglobal.com/images/uploads/2017/06/19030377_1353377418102617_1311021061618575270_n.jpg&#34; width=&#34;720&#34;/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;p1&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;18892978_1353377358102623_8707732293163757932_n&#34; class=&#34;alignnone size-full wp-image-2121&#34; height=&#34;960&#34; src=&#34;https://www.saraffglobalhugo.saraffglobal.com/images/uploads/2017/06/18892978_1353377358102623_8707732293163757932_n.jpg&#34; width=&#34;915&#34;/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;p1&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;18920891_1353377408102618_8350026714602801005_o&#34; class=&#34;alignnone size-full wp-image-2122&#34; height=&#34;1408&#34; src=&#34;https://www.saraffglobalhugo.saraffglobal.com/images/uploads/2017/06/18920891_1353377408102618_8350026714602801005_o.jpg&#34; width=&#34;2048&#34;/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
